{"ld": 2213, "paper": "HP1492", "session": "132", "title": "An Act Making Supplemental Allocations from the Highway Fund and Other Funds for the Expenditures of State Government and Changing Certain Provisions of the Law Necessary to the Proper Operations of State Government for the Fiscal Years Ending June 30, 2026 and June 30, 2027 (EMERGENCY) (GOVERNOR'S BILL)", "sponsor_id": "h-crafts-lydia", "cosponsor_ids": [], "committee_code": "TRA", "committee_name": "Transportation", "summary": {"text": "This bill is a concept draft pursuant to Joint Rule 208.\n\nThis bill, as emergency legislation, proposes to make supplemental allocations from the Highway Fund and other funds for the expenditures of State Government and change certain provisions of the law necessary to the proper operations of State Government for the fiscal years ending June 30, 2026 and June 30, 2027, as submitted by the Governor pursuant to the Maine Revised Statutes, Title 5.\n\nThe documents submitted by the Governor may be found here:\n\nhttps://legislature.maine.gov/12584.", "official": true, "source": "Bill text, https://legislature.maine.gov/legis/bills/getPDF.asp?paper=HP1492&item=1&snum=132"}, "status": "enacted", "status_label": "Emergency Enacted", "final_disposition": {"label": "Emergency Enacted", "date": "2026-04-16", "governor_action": "Emergency Signed", "governor_action_date": "2026-04-16"}, "fiscal_status": "Not Yet Determined", "documents": [{"label": "Bill text (LD 2213)", "url": "https://legislature.maine.gov/legis/bills/getPDF.asp?paper=HP1492&item=1&snum=132", "item": 1}, {"label": "Amendment C-A (H-1037)", "url": "https://legislature.maine.gov/legis/bills/getPDF.asp?paper=HP1492&item=2&snum=132", "item": 2}, {"label": "Amendment S-A to C-A (S-697)", "url": "https://legislature.maine.gov/legis/bills/getPDF.asp?paper=HP1492&item=6&snum=132", "item": 6}], "amendments": [{"id": "C-A (H-1037)", "description": "Emergency", "sponsor": null, "status": "Adopted by House & Senate", "url":